WEBVTT

00:00:27.988 --> 00:00:30.964
so before we move onward,

00:00:30.988 --> 00:00:32.742
may I go back a bit,

00:00:32.766 --> 00:00:35.940
since we have known each other
for a long time,

00:00:35.964 --> 00:00:42.038
and talk about those early days
when you were building a movement,

00:00:42.062 --> 00:00:44.371
challenging stereotypes,

00:00:44.395 --> 00:00:47.102
moving beyond cultural norms.

00:00:47.126 --> 00:00:51.498
You must have had some manifestation
of "Fearless" in your life.

00:00:51.522 --> 00:00:55.585
What were your fears
and how did you overcome them?

00:00:56.847 --> 00:00:58.823
GS: No, I certainly had a lot of fears,

00:00:58.847 --> 00:01:02.047
and chief among them
was speaking in public,